 "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/5698504a6ed95b26ea2f8976434cb196.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/5698504a6ed95b26ea2f8976434cb196.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p></p><br><h1>ゲームについて</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/c007470f3c44fe46da4f6be0f693c797.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/c007470f3c44fe46da4f6be0f693c797.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Seaside Wash』</strong>は、臨場感あふれる洗浄音と心地よいBGMを組み合わせ、穏やかで魅力的な体験を生み出します。錆びつき、傷んだ船が徐々に元の美しい姿を取り戻していく様子は、作業を進めるたびに達成感を与えてくれます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ec6c33d044ffd005f08aade56c79e1e5.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/ec6c33d044ffd005f08aade56c79e1e5.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >表面や汚れの種類によって、必要な道具は異なります。それぞれの掃除作業には最適な道具と方法が必要であり、最良の結果を得るためには、効率を最大限に高めるよう慎重に選びましょう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/b631fe5e47a069d4ba14a366a4433c37.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/b631fe5e47a069d4ba14a366a4433c37.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >工具をアップグレードしたり修理したりして効率を高め、より過酷でやりがいのある仕事に取り組みましょう。修復作業がより困難になるにつれて、より優れた工具をアンロックし、作業手法を磨き上げていきましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/a39b7e16acc7fbbc08e2b333babd8d81.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/a39b7e16acc7fbbc08e2b333babd8d81.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小型の漁船から巨大な貨物船まで、さまざまな船舶の作業に取り組みます。それぞれの船には独自の構造や規模があり、修復を待つ清掃上の課題が待ち受けています。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/319c443ffe501239f7cb7a3c5ae03302.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/319c443ffe501239f7cb7a3c5ae03302.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >船体や船首からマスト、甲板、船内まで、船の隅々まできれいに掃除しましょう。汚れや隠れた場所が至る所にあり、やりがいのある修復作業が楽しめる、細部まで作り込まれた作業エリアを探索してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/7c08c9156476a33eacda3b1c93e0a672.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/7c08c9156476a33eacda3b1c93e0a672.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >塩分、錆、そして頑固なフジツボなど、それぞれ異なる洗浄方法が必要な汚れに対処しましょう。各種類の汚れの性質を理解し、効果的に除去するための最適な方法を選びましょう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/94a0c167df9f4d6dce47bed5624edd01.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/94a0c167df9f4d6dce47bed5624edd01.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >自分のペースで仕事を請け負い、手持ちの道具や戦略、時間に合ったタスクを選びましょう。評判を高め、工房を充実させながら、さまざまなタスクを自由にこなしていけます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/e0cde982dcb07732836e76cfb17d9764.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/e0cde982dcb07732836e76cfb17d9764.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >仕事の合間には、居心地の良い海辺の家で、釣りや料理などのリラックスできるミニゲームを楽しんで、ひと息つきましょう。日々の修復作業から離れて、心安らぐ海辺のひとときを満喫してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>特徴</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ 没入感あふれる精巧な作業環境で、多種多様な船舶の修復に取り組みましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 専用の工具やワークショップシステムを活用して、難易度の高い修復作業に挑みましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 やりがいのある成長システムを通じて、作業スペースをアップグレード・拡張しましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 屋内と屋外が融合した多階層の海辺エリアで作業を行いましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ ダイナミックな天候、昼夜のサイクル、そして心安らぐ海辺のイベントを体験しましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >準備はいいですか？『Seaside Wash』の最新ニュースやアップデート情報を入手するには、ぜひDiscordに参加してください！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/c007470f3c44fe46da4f6be0f693c797.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/c007470f3c44fe46da4f6be0f693c797.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Seaside Wash』</strong>は、臨場感あふれる洗浄音と心地よいBGMを組み合わせ、穏やかで魅力的な体験を生み出します。錆びつき、傷んだ船が徐々に元の美しい姿を取り戻していく様子は、作業を進めるたびに達成感を与えてくれます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ec6c33d044ffd005f08aade56c79e1e5.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/ec6c33d044ffd005f08aade56c79e1e5.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >表面や汚れの種類によって、必要な道具は異なります。それぞれの掃除作業には最適な道具と方法が必要であり、最良の結果を得るためには、効率を最大限に高めるよう慎重に選びましょう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/b631fe5e47a069d4ba14a366a4433c37.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/b631fe5e47a069d4ba14a366a4433c37.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >工具をアップグレードしたり修理したりして効率を高め、より過酷でやりがいのある仕事に取り組みましょう。修復作業がより困難になるにつれて、より優れた工具をアンロックし、作業手法を磨き上げていきましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/a39b7e16acc7fbbc08e2b333babd8d81.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/a39b7e16acc7fbbc08e2b333babd8d81.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小型の漁船から巨大な貨物船まで、さまざまな船舶の作業に取り組みます。それぞれの船には独自の構造や規模があり、修復を待つ清掃上の課題が待ち受けています。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/319c443ffe501239f7cb7a3c5ae03302.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/319c443ffe501239f7cb7a3c5ae03302.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >船体や船首からマスト、甲板、船内まで、船の隅々まできれいに掃除しましょう。汚れや隠れた場所が至る所にあり、やりがいのある修復作業が楽しめる、細部まで作り込まれた作業エリアを探索してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/7c08c9156476a33eacda3b1c93e0a672.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/7c08c9156476a33eacda3b1c93e0a672.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >塩分、錆、そして頑固なフジツボなど、それぞれ異なる洗浄方法が必要な汚れに対処しましょう。各種類の汚れの性質を理解し、効果的に除去するための最適な方法を選びましょう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/94a0c167df9f4d6dce47bed5624edd01.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/94a0c167df9f4d6dce47bed5624edd01.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >自分のペースで仕事を請け負い、手持ちの道具や戦略、時間に合ったタスクを選びましょう。評判を高め、工房を充実させながら、さまざまなタスクを自由にこなしていけます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/e0cde982dcb07732836e76cfb17d9764.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/e0cde982dcb07732836e76cfb17d9764.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >仕事の合間には、居心地の良い海辺の家で、釣りや料理などのリラックスできるミニゲームを楽しんで、ひと息つきましょう。日々の修復作業から離れて、心安らぐ海辺のひとときを満喫してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>特徴</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ 没入感あふれる精巧な作業環境で、多種多様な船舶の修復に取り組みましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 専用の工具やワークショップシステムを活用して、難易度の高い修復作業に挑みましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 やりがいのある成長システムを通じて、作業スペースをアップグレード・拡張しましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 屋内と屋外が融合した多階層の海辺エリアで作業を行いましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ ダイナミックな天候、昼夜のサイクル、そして心安らぐ海辺のイベントを体験しましょう</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >準備はいいですか？『Seaside Wash』の最新ニュースやアップデート情報を入手するには、ぜひDiscordに参加してください！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>",
 "short_description": "『Seaside Wash』は、錆やフジツボに覆われた船を清掃・修理し、新品同様の状態へと修復していく、ほっこりとした仕事シミュレーターです。道具をアップグレードし、ビジネスを拡大し、珍しい品々を見つけ出し、自分だけの船を建造し、のどかな海辺のアクティビティを楽しみましょう。",
 "supported_languages": "英語, フランス語, イタリア語, ドイツ語, インドネシア語, 日本語, 韓国語, ポーランド語, ポルトガル語－ブラジル, ロシア語, 中国語（簡体字）, タイ語, 中国語（繁体字）, トルコ語, ベトナム語",
